<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
      <div rend="parallel"> 
        <p xml:id="Aink164-kilavi">
          talaimakaṉukkup puṟattoḻukka muḷatākiyavaḻit talaimakaḷ tōḻikkuc colliyatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
          Spoken by the heroine to the confidante, as going around with other women was taking place for the hero.</p>
    </div>  
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink164">
<l>peruṅkaṭaṟ karaiyatu ciṟuveṇ kākkai</l>
<l>yiruṅkaḻi maruṅki ṉayirai yārun</l>
<l>taṇṇan tuṟaivaṉ ṟakuti</l>
<l>nammō ṭamaiyā talarpayan taṉṟē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>The entitlement of the man from the cool, pretty shore </l>
        <l>In which the small, white crow of the vast seashore </l>
        <l>Consumes Ayirai fish in the dark backwaters</l>
        <l>Does not sit well with us. </l>
        <l>It has produced gossip.</l>      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
